script = ExtResource( 2 )
histoire = "Gareth, a formidable warrior crackling with electric power, commands a presence as striking as the lightning that courses through his veins. Born under a fateful storm, Gareth wields his electrifying abilities with unparalleled mastery, channeling bolts of energy to vanquish his foes. His stoic demeanor and focused determination lend an air of intensity to his every move. Though Gareth may seem distant and formidable, his electric power serves as a formidable reminder of his unwavering strength and the sheer force he brings to bear against any who dare to challenge him."
